        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: KAGB, KAPA\n- Places: Waimea, Hawaiʻi County, Hawaiʻi, United States\n- Topics: radio broadcasting, Adult Contemporary format, census population\n\nFacts:\n- In 2000, Waimea in Hawaiʻi County, Hawaiʻi, United States, had a population of 7,028.\n- In 2010, Waimea in Hawaiʻi County, Hawaiʻi, United States, had a population of 9,212.\n- Waimea is a census-designated place in Hawaiʻi County, Hawaiʻi, United States.\n- KAGB is a radio station on 99.1 FM licensed to Waimea, Hawaii, United States.\n- KAGB broadcasts an Adult Contemporary format and simulcasts Hilo-based KAPA.",
